  "instruction": "Enable Windows Narrator as a visual accessibility aid and keep it enabled throughout the task. Open the provided DeliveryConfirmation.jpg image and use Narrator to review the delivery information. Identify the tracking number and expected delivery date. Then open Thunderbird Calendar and create an all-day event named `Package Delivery - HXAU-4827-1936` on the expected delivery date. Add the tracking number `HXAU-4827-1936` to the event description and save the event.",
  "source": "Local Image: assets/DeliveryConfirmation.jpg",
