    "Open DeliveryConfirmation.jpg.",
    "Review the delivery confirmation image.",
    "Identify the tracking number as HXAU-4827-1936.",
    "Identify the expected delivery date as Thursday, 5 November 2026.",
    "Open Thunderbird Calendar.",
    "Create a new all-day calendar event.",
    "Set the event title to Package Delivery - HXAU-4827-1936.",
    "Set the event date to 5 November 2026.",
    "Add HXAU-4827-1936 to the event description.",
    "Save the calendar event.",
    "Keep Narrator enabled."
